    "statistics":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["sourcesIndexed","sourcesContentAnalyzed","sourcesMetadataOnly","sourcesInaccessible","duplicateGroups","factsByDomain","sourcesByMachineFamily","existingConflictsSupported","existingConflictsContradicted","newConflictsDiscovered"],"properties":{"sourcesIndexed":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"sourcesContentAnalyzed":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"sourcesMetadataOnly":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"sourcesInaccessible":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"duplicateGroups":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"factsByDomain":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"integer","minimum":0}},"sourcesByMachineFamily":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"integer","minimum":0}},"existingConflictsSupported":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","pattern":"^C-0[0-3][0-9]$"}},"existingConflictsContradicted":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","pattern":"^C-0[0-3][0-9]$"}},"newConflictsDiscovered":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","pattern":"^C-04[0-9]$"}}}}
