    "fact":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["factId","domain","candidateProductModel","physicalState","value","unit","sourceIds","sourceLocation","evidenceDateOrRevision","decisionState","conflictIds","humanReviewRequired"],"properties":{"factId":{"type":"string","pattern":"^FACT-[0-9]{3}$"},"domain":{"enum":["voltage","phase","frequency","motor_power","motor_speed","machine_dimensions","net_weight","packaged_dimensions","shipping_weight","wheel_blade_size","arbor_mount","water_system","included_components","optional_components","part_numbers","replacement_parts","consumables","accessories","assembly","safety","model_identity"]},"candidateProductModel":{"type":"string","minLength":2},"physicalState":{"type":"string","minLength":2},"value":{},"unit":{"type":["string","null"]},"sourceIds":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"items":{"type":"string"}},"sourceLocation":{"type":"string","minLength":2},"evidenceDateOrRevision":{"type":["string","null"]},"decisionState":{"$ref":"#/$defs/state"},"conflictIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","pattern":"^C-0[0-4][0-9]$"}},"humanReviewRequired":{"type":"boolean"}}},
